# 2-D (user request 2026-10-26): an airfoil profile extruded 10 mm (the user's NACA_Airfoil.STL, in mm), flow along its chord:
# the mesher says it looks 2-D, Mesh it 2-D makes it one cell thick (front2D, back2D empty), it runs, and the cross section
# shows the profile. Then Generate with results there opens Clean results first, and Clean and continue meshes again.
budget p95 80 max 600
shell mkdir -p $SB/ws/naca/system && cp "$QC_TESTS/tools/NACA_Airfoil.STL" $SB/ws/NACA_Airfoil.STL && printf 'FoamFile { version 2.0; format ascii; class dictionary; object controlDict; }\napplication simpleFoam;\nstartTime 0;\nendTime 10;\ndeltaT 1;\nwriteControl timeStep;\nwriteInterval 10;\n' > $SB/ws/naca/system/controlDict
open $SB/ws/naca
click nav:mesh
wait-until page Mesh
click text:STL mesher
wait 5
click stl-path
enter $SB/ws/NACA_Airfoil.STL
wait 10
click stl-units#2
wait 10
click stl-next
wait 3
click stl-domain#1
wait 10
click stl-flow#2
wait 10
assert text This looks 2-D
screenshot $OUT/1_loaded.png
click stl-2d-fix
wait 10
assert log mesher/mesher.ini two_d = 1
assert log mesher/mesher.ini two_d_normal = x
screenshot $OUT/2_twod.png
click wf-next
wait-until job running timeout 20
wait-until job finished timeout 400
assert log log.checkMesh Mesh OK.
assert log constant/polyMesh/boundary empty
note the extrusion's end caps (Back, Front) are left out: snapped to, they pulled the profile out of its plane
assert not log constant/polyMesh/boundary Back
assert not log constant/polyMesh/boundary Front
assert not log system/snappyHexMeshDict regions/Back.stl
click wf-next
wait 10
assert file 0/U
shell foamDictionary system/controlDict -entry endTime -set 50 > /dev/null && foamDictionary system/controlDict -entry writeInterval -set 50 > /dev/null
wait 20
click nav:run
wait-until page Run
wait 10
click wf-next
wait-until job running timeout 30
wait-until job finished timeout 400
assert log log.simpleFoam End
click nav:overview
wait-until page Overview
wait 40
screenshot $OUT/3_overview.png
click nav:mesh
wait-until page Mesh
click text:View
wait 40
screenshot $OUT/4_view.png
note Generate with results on disk: the Clean dialog, then the mesh
click text:STL mesher
wait 10
click stl-gen
wait 10
assert modal clean
assert text Clean results first
screenshot $OUT/5_clean_first.png
click m-clean-go
wait-until job running timeout 20
wait-until job finished timeout 400
assert log log.checkMesh Mesh OK.
assert not file 50
